    "enUS": {
      "description": "I must say, {class}. I have not felt this optimistic in some time. This tincture could be the panacea that saves us from the satyr's ever-expanding blight. Even if we remain in these camps for the rest of our lives we will stand strong and free of corruption.\r\n\r\nGo to Furze and give him this panacea. He has suffered for long enough. Return to me to report any findings.",
